<title>USA: Quickturn Design to merge with SpeedSim.</title>
<headline>Quickturn Design to merge with SpeedSim.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quickturn Design Systems Inc said it agreed to merge with SpeedSim Inc, a privately-held software company based in Chelmsford, Mass. It said Quickturn specializes in cycle-based simulation technology.</p>
<p>Quickturn said it will account for the transaction as a pooling of interests. Under terms of the agreement, Quickturn will issue about 2.8 million of its common shares in exchange for all of SpeedSim.</p>
</text>
